      "id": 1765,
      "hub_id": 2400,
      "guid": "com.lefthandedcat.catburglar",
      "name": "The Cat Burglar",
      "slug": "the-cat-burglar",
      "teaser": "Every key(and keycard) in all of Tarkov for sale at a reasonable and balanced price for a no flea playthrough.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2400.jpg",
      "downloads": 9308,
      "favourites_count": 12,
      "description": "<p>WARNING: this is a trader mod, which means changes to your profile after adding it can be irreversible. While I don’t see this mod causing any issues I still would recommend a backup of your profiles folder before installing just in case!</p>\n<p>Ever had your no flea playthrough completely ruined by Tarcone Director’s key and not been able to find a solution that doesn’t feel like cheating or isn’t backdoor bandit? Well fear not! The Cat Burglar is here to solve those problems, he sells every key and keycard at a fair and balanced price with no silly loyalty requirements. If you feel like his prices are unreasonable(too high OR too low) just open config.json and edit the “itempricemultiplier” line as you please(1 is 1x multiplier, you can set this to a non whole number like 2.3 if you want 230% or 0.2 if you want 20% prices as well)</p>\n<p>Most of the credit goes to AcidPhantasm for his mod HarryHideout, nearly all the code from this is a modified or direct copy of his code other than the code to find all the keys in both this version and the 3.11 version.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1765/the-cat-burglar",
